The key to piloting Squall, SeeD Mercenary is understanding its core engine: Squall grants double strike to any creature attacking alone. Whenever Squall connects with combat damage, he recurs any permanent with mana value 3 or less from the graveyard straight to the battlefield, hitting twice with double strike to reanimate two permanents per turn.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Smothering Tithe, Teferi's Protection, Demonic Tutor. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

